        dct:description "dichotomous fraction = 0.965, trifurcation fraction = 0.035" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Interior stream-order bifurcation ratio from Strahler ordering of 3D simulated ureteric tree across g=1..8" ;
        schema:name "Horton-Strahler ureteric tree bifurcation ratio R_b (Short et al. 2014 Fig. 3)" ;
